# GATED HAZARDOUS DATA — never commit. The WMDP bio-forget-corpus is dual-use/restricted
# (CAIS gated download); the unlearning eval reads it from ./sae_bench/evals/unlearning/data/.
# Ignore the whole vendored sae_bench data dir we create under the repo root, plus the file by name
# anywhere, so an auto-save (GIT_PUSH) can never sweep it in.
sae_bench/
bio-forget-corpus.jsonl
*bio-forget*
*forget-corpus*
*wmdp*corpus*
